WEBVTT

00:03:28.736 --> 00:03:30.894
We can't settle for that,

00:03:30.894 --> 00:03:35.398
which is why the concern about the eighth goal,

00:03:35.398 --> 00:03:37.218
which relates to funding,

00:03:37.218 --> 00:03:40.132
which I said at the beginning is falling,

00:03:40.132 --> 00:03:44.592
is so troubling.

00:03:44.592 --> 00:03:46.646
So what can be done?

00:03:46.646 --> 00:03:49.638
Well, I work in financial markets,

00:03:49.638 --> 00:03:52.089
not development.

00:03:52.089 --> 00:03:55.126
I study the behavior of investors,

00:03:55.126 --> 00:04:00.712
how they react to policy and the economy.